quadrantChart
    title Contoso recovery options - speed against isolation from the source account
    x-axis Shares the storage account blast radius --> Independent of the storage account
    y-axis Hours to days of RTO --> Seconds to minutes of RTO
    quadrant-1 Fast and isolated - nothing sits here, so combine tiers
    quadrant-2 Fast but dies with the account - first line only
    quadrant-3 Slow and dies with the account - never rely on this alone
    quadrant-4 Isolated but slow - the last line that must always exist
